These are the most common struct types:
• Numbers: byte, sbyte, short, ushort, int, uint, long, ulong, float,
double, and decimal
• Miscellaneous: char and bool
• System.Drawing: Color, Point, and Rectangle
Almost all the other types are class types, including string.
Apart from the difference in where in memory the data for a type is stored, the other
major difference is that you cannot inherit from a struct.
